<title>UK: AssiDoman downgraded by Goldman.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman downgraded by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group AssiDoman AB was downgraded to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;trading buy&quot; by Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Louise Ireland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
